omaton are introduced and their relation to the classical automata is determined. Some decision problems concerning automata are shown to be solvable by effective algorithms; others turn out to be unsolvable by algorithms.},\n issn = {0018-8646, 0018-8646}\n}"}]},{"relation":"meta","args":[{"t":"entry","v":"rabinFiniteAutomataTheir1959"},{"t":"str","v":"container"},{"t":"str","v":"IBM Journal of Research and Development"}]},{"relation":"meta","args":[{"t":"entry","v":"rabinFiniteAutomataTheir1959"},{"t":"str","v":"doi"},{"t":"str","v":"10.1147/rd.32.0114"}]},{"relation":"meta","args":[{"t":"entry","v":"rabinFiniteAutomataTheir1959"},{"t":"str","v":"entry-type"},{"t":"str","v":"article"}]},{"relation":"meta","args":[{"t":"entry","v":"rabinFiniteAutomataTheir1959"},{"t":"str","v":"month"},{"t":"int","v":4}]},{"relation":"meta","args":[{"t":"entry","v":"rabinFiniteAutomataTheir1959"},{"t":"str","v":"number"},{"t":"str","v":"2"}]},{"relation":"meta","args":[{"t":"entry","v":"rabinFiniteAutomataTheir1959"},{"t":"str","v":"pages"},{"t":"str","v":"114--125"}]},{"relation":"meta","args":[{"t":"entry","v":"rabinFiniteAutomataTheir1959"},{"t":"str","v":"url"},{"t":"str","v":"http://ieeexplore.ieee.org/document/5392601/"}]},{"relation":"meta","args":[{"t":"entry","v":"rabinFiniteAutomataTheir1959"},{"t":"str","v":"venue"},{"t":"str","v":"ibm-journal-of-research-and-development"}]},{"relation":"meta","args":[{"t":"entry","v":"rabinFiniteAutomataTheir1959"},{"t":"str","v":"visibility"},{"t":"str","v":"public"}]},{"relation":"meta","args":[{"t":"entry","v":"rabinFiniteAutomataTheir1959"},{"t":"str","v":"volume"},{"t":"str","v":"3"}]},{"relation":"meta","args":[{"t":"entry","v":"rabinFiniteAutomataTheir1959"},{"t":"str","v":"year"},{"t":"int","v":1959}]},{"relation":"path","args":[{"t":"entry","v":"rabinFiniteAutomataTheir1959"},{"t":"str","v":"entries/refs/rabinFiniteAutomataTheir1959/rabinFiniteAutomataTheir1959.hel"}]},{"relation":"reference","args":[{"t":"entry","v":"rabinFini